these days, right?

253
00:14:44,220 --> 00:14:46,520
When you're home, you miss working,

254
00:14:46,920 --> 00:14:48,130
but when you work,

255
00:14:48,130 --> 00:14:49,130
you can't stop worrying
about the child you left behind.

256
00:14:49,190 --> 00:14:50,290
Is it like that for you too?

257
00:14:51,530 --> 00:14:52,600
It was even worse for me.

258
00:14:52,600 --> 00:14:54,630
I went back to work
right after his first birthday.

259
00:14:55,570 --> 00:14:57,970
That's why I feel especially guilty
on days like today.

260
00:14:58,870 --> 00:15:02,310
- The other moms all volunteer for this.
- I hate you, Mommy.

261
00:15:02,970 --> 00:15:04,110
Park Seo Jun.

262
00:15:04,410 --> 00:15:06,440
You shouldn't say such mean things
to your mother.

263
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,480
Ridiculous, right?

264
00:15:09,010 --> 00:15:10,080
I hate you, Mommy.

265
00:15:10,810 --> 00:15:12,120
Yul, do you hate Mommy too?

266
00:15:13,050 --> 00:15:14,050
I'm sorry.

267
00:15:14,390 --> 00:15:15,390
Oh, dear.

268
00:15:16,420 --> 00:15:18,460
- Go on in.
- Go on in. We'll see you later.

269
00:15:19,590 --> 00:15:21,490
- Bye.
- Oh my.

270
00:15:22,090 --> 00:15:23,490
What's with the two of them
all of a sudden?

271
00:15:23,630 --> 00:15:26,860
Misery loves company.
Helping each other out.

272
00:15:27,130 --> 00:15:29,770
- Hello.
- Hello.

273
00:15:30,370 --> 00:15:31,400
Hello, ma'am.

274
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:34,140
Oh my, Seo Jun and Yul
came together today.

275
00:15:34,970 --> 00:15:36,540
Hello, ma'am.

276
00:15:39,340 --> 00:15:40,340
You little brat.

277
00:15:41,380 --> 00:15:42,580
I'm so sorry.

278
00:15:42,850 --> 00:15:44,350
No, it's all right.

279
00:15:44,950 --> 00:15:46,380
Ma'am, please take good care of him
again today.

280
00:15:47,150 --> 00:15:49,920
Yul's mom, thank you so much for today.

281
00:15:50,620 --> 00:15:51,690
I'll treat you to coffee.

282
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:53,420
- It's fine.
- I have to go.

283
00:15:53,420 --> 00:15:54,690
Yes, you should get going. Bye.

284
00:15:55,290 --> 00:15:58,430
Yul, you have to say goodbye to Mommy too.
Come on, sweetie.

285
00:15:58,800 --> 00:16:00,860
Get along with your friends today...

286
00:16:01,130 --> 00:16:02,300
