287
00:16:03,330 --> 00:16:04,870
Don't worry too much, ma'am.

288
00:16:05,870 --> 00:16:07,200
Please take good care of her.

289
00:16:08,270 --> 00:16:11,040
(Joa Daycare Center)

290
00:16:11,940 --> 00:16:14,480
Oh dear, Yul seems especially down today.

291
00:16:15,180 --> 00:16:18,050
It's her way of protesting
against her mom.

292
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:20,150
Her mom must be heartbroken. Oh, no.

293
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:22,190
What do you mean, "Oh, no?"

294
00:16:22,220 --> 00:16:24,490
Both the mother and the child
have to get over it.

295
00:16:27,020 --> 00:16:28,190
(Reform The Mind, Correct The Behavior)

296
00:16:28,190 --> 00:16:30,190
1503, Pyo Gyu Cheol, you're released.

297
00:16:35,970 --> 00:16:37,030
Don't you have any belongings?

298
00:16:40,740 --> 00:16:41,740
I don't need anything.

299
00:16:50,050 --> 00:16:52,080
Gosh, that punk.
Acting all tough now that he's out.

300
00:16:59,890 --> 00:17:02,890
(Durumi Electronics)

301
00:17:12,340 --> 00:17:14,070
(Joa Daycare Center)

302
00:17:36,190 --> 00:17:39,500
Pyo Gyu Cheol.
As per the court order, from this moment,

303
00:17:39,560 --> 00:17:41,370
I will be fitting you
with an electronic ankle monitor.

304
00:17:41,630 --> 00:17:42,730
Okay.

305
00:17:43,670 --> 00:17:45,000
Just get this over with quickly.

306
00:17:53,740 --> 00:17:55,210
Hey. Be gentle.

307
00:18:01,950 --> 00:18:03,220
Go now. Run, run!

308
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:05,560
- Goodness.
- Look at us go.

309
00:18:07,490 --> 00:18:08,530
Say cheese.

310
00:18:09,330 --> 00:18:10,490
Let's go.

311
00:18:13,730 --> 00:18:17,200
Slowly. That's a big one, Hae Yi.

312
00:18:19,570 --> 00:18:22,740
That's it. Oh, so pretty. Yul.

313
00:18:23,410 --> 00:18:24,410
Yul.

314
00:18:24,410 --> 00:18:27,910
Yul, give me a peace sign.
Are you not in the mood for a picture?

315
00:18:39,320 --> 00:18:41,330
- Mom.
- Yul, do want to do it with Mommy?

316
00:18:41,890 --> 00:18:42,890
Here, look.

317
00:18:43,230 --> 00:18:44,930
The mouse.
Okay, aim right for the mouse's head.

318
00:18:47,330 --> 00:18:48,330
Yul, look.

319
00:18:48,700 --> 00:18:50,470
It's going up.

320
00:18:50,670 --> 00:18:52,400
First place.

321
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:54,870
Yul, you did great.

322
00:18:58,110 --> 00:18:59,210
Be careful, be careful.

323
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:00,980
Look here. Say cheese.

324
00:19:03,210 --> 00:19:04,950
Ye Geon, be careful. Careful.

325
00:19:06,750 --> 00:19:07,750
Kids will be kids.

326
00:19:08,750 --> 00:19:10,990
I thought you couldn't make it.
What brings you here?

327
00:19:12,090 --> 00:19:13,660
It wasn't anything particularly urgent,

328
00:19:13,720 --> 00:19:15,890
so I just asked for permission at work
and took a half-day off.

329
00:19:16,230 --> 00:19:19,160
Good for you.
You left after seeing her so down.

330
00:19:19,230 --> 00:19:21,170
How could you possibly focus on work?

331
00:19:22,730 --> 00:19:25,100
If only kids understood
how we mothers feel,

332
00:19:25,370 --> 00:19:28,370
- wouldn't that be great?
- Kids are all like that at this age.

333
00:19:29,170 --> 00:19:31,140
It's an age where they
develop a sense of self,

334
00:19:31,140 --> 00:19:33,310
but they're still self-centered.

335
00:19:33,310 --> 00:19:34,850
Understanding other people's
perspectives...

336
00:19:34,850 --> 00:19:36,580
is only possible from age six.

337
00:19:37,380 --> 00:19:38,380
That's right.

338
00:19:38,450 --> 00:19:43,020
It's important to teach kids
the rules of daily life at this age,

339
00:19:43,420 --> 00:19:44,860
but it's not easy.

340
00:19:44,860 --> 00:19:47,290
- I find that incredibly difficult.
- Me too.

341
00:19:47,590 --> 00:19:50,660
I mean, sometimes they say to be firm,
and other times to be lenient.

342
00:19:51,430 --> 00:19:52,830
They say to balance
being strict and gentle...

343
00:19:52,830 --> 00:19:54,160
so the kids don't get confused.

344
00:19:54,360 --> 00:19:56,900
I mean, that's easier said than done.
Is that even possible?

345
00:19:56,970 --> 00:19:58,770
It's difficult and tough.

346
00:19:59,870 --> 00:20:00,870
But...

347
00:20:01,440 --> 00:20:04,270
They say this is the most precious time
for a mother and child.

348
00:20:05,210 --> 00:20:07,950
The memories that form the bond
between a mother and child...

349
00:20:08,010 --> 00:20:10,780
- are created around this time.
- Start.

350
00:20:14,320 --> 00:20:15,490
Oh, my sweet child.

351
00:20:15,650 --> 00:20:16,650
How pretty.

352
00:20:16,890 --> 00:20:17,990
Ye Geon, be careful.

353
00:20:18,090 --> 00:20:19,160
Be careful.

354
00:20:19,390 --> 00:20:20,390
What is this?

355
00:20:20,890 --> 00:20:22,330
Why is that bastard getting out?

356
00:20:22,490 --> 00:20:24,960
- What? Who's getting out?
- Pyo Gyu Cheol.

357
00:20:25,160 --> 00:20:26,600
- Look at this.
- I'm here...

358
00:20:26,700 --> 00:20:28,470
at the main gate of Jungryeong Prison,
where tensions are running high.

359
00:20:29,070 --> 00:20:30,870
Fierce protests from many citizens
have been ongoing...

360
00:20:30,870 --> 00:20:32,340
since early this morning.

361
00:20:32,500 --> 00:20:35,010
Pyo Gyu Cheol, known as the nation's
worst child sex offender,

362
00:20:35,070 --> 00:20:37,510
is being released today
after serving a 16-year sentence.

363
00:20:37,570 --> 00:20:40,340
The inclusion of an eight-year-old child
among his victims...

364
00:20:40,440 --> 00:20:43,010
has caused great shock and public outrage.

365
00:20:43,680 --> 00:20:44,820
Pyo Gyu Cheol's Law.

366
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:47,520
The laws punishing
sex crimes against children...

367
00:20:47,520 --> 00:20:48,750
were significantly strengthened in 2010,

368
00:20:48,950 --> 00:20:53,090
but because Pyo Gyu Cheol's crime
was subject to the law prior to 2009,

369
00:20:53,420 --> 00:20:56,460
he was released after serving a relatively
short sentence of only 16 years.

370
00:20:57,090 --> 00:20:58,300
Enraged by this, citizens...

371
00:20:58,560 --> 00:21:00,960
have demanded the retroactive application
of the strengthened law.

372
00:21:01,670 --> 00:21:04,100
How could anyone do that
to an eight-year-old child?

373
00:21:04,870 --> 00:21:06,840
I mean, the mom forums are already
going crazy about this,

374
00:21:06,900 --> 00:21:09,270
and that guy is really getting out? Why?

375
00:21:09,540 --> 00:21:12,440
Why else? They're letting him out
because he served his time.

376
00:21:12,510 --> 00:21:14,540
Well, then, to make sure
he'd never get out,

377
00:21:14,610 --> 00:21:17,310
