408
00:23:14,160 --> 00:23:16,900
The ones who go after kids.
Like child sex offenders.

409
00:23:18,100 --> 00:23:20,140
I mean, there isn't a single one
among his victims.

410
00:23:20,540 --> 00:23:23,970
Honestly, given the severity of the crime,
aren't they the absolute worst?

411
00:23:24,040 --> 00:23:25,110
They have a high reoffending rate too.

412
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:26,640
Beom.

413
00:23:27,010 --> 00:23:28,350
I want you to track...

414
00:23:28,350 --> 00:23:30,050
