released in the last 15 years.

415
00:23:30,510 --> 00:23:31,520
Track them?

416
00:23:32,050 --> 00:23:33,850
- For what?
- To see if they're still alive and well.

417
00:23:35,520 --> 00:23:36,550
(Violent Crimes Unit 2)

418
00:23:42,530 --> 00:23:44,390
I've narrowed down
the child sex offenders released...

419
00:23:44,460 --> 00:23:46,060
