430
00:24:16,360 --> 00:24:18,830
This is all very suspicious,
don't you think? Right?

431
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:20,430
Sounds unbelievable, right?

432
00:24:22,130 --> 00:24:24,400
When is Pyo Gyu Cheol getting released?

433
00:24:26,140 --> 00:24:27,140
Pyo Gyu Cheol.

434
