440
00:24:48,760 --> 00:24:49,760
Stay on him.

441
00:24:50,630 --> 00:24:51,630
Yes, sir.

442
00:24:54,230 --> 00:24:55,230
Pyo Gyu Cheol.

443
00:24:55,600 --> 00:24:56,600
Did you see that?

444
00:24:57,170 --> 00:24:58,170
